Suddenly, large drops of water fall.
Soon, a heavy shower begins.
This is my first experience of rain in Mumbai.
I smile.
It is not hot now.
A cool wind blows.
I quickly go near a shop.
Other people also come there.
We all stand under the shop's awning.
This way we stay dry.
We watch the rain on the street.
After some time, the rain lightens.
My BEST bus arrives.
I enter the bus.
The morning forecast is true.
It will rain tonight as well.
I happily go home.
